The normal line to the surface at the point $(4, 2, -2)$ is in the direction of the normal vector $\mathbf{n}$.
The equation of the normal line is
$$ (x, y, y) = (4, 2, -2) + t(8, 4, -36) $$
Thus,
$$ x = 4 + 8t \\ y = 2 + 4t \\ y = -2 - 36t $$
