W<sub>B</sub> = Q<sub>H</sub> - Q<sub>B</sub> = 996.67 - 544 = 456.67 kJ/kJ

Therefore, the **Work delivered per kg of air (W<sub>B</sub>) is approximately 456.67 kJ/kg.**

